  "description": "Lyricist Choi Woo-Rim, but now an unknown who can't make money as a lyricist. Choi Woo-Rim is busy working as a company employee during the day and a lyricist at night to make a living. Then one day, Woo-Rim meets his favorite celebrity, Ki Yoo-Seong, who planted in his mind the dream of becoming a lyricist. Ki Yoo-Seong is a man... completely different from what I thought!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
